                                "sense_id": "bbd3f51f-d1da-3fb6-9e5b-267f20c820e8",
                                "text": "This is hell, this is the image of death, this is hell, ſuch an euil fauored face, ſuch an ugſom countenance, ſuche an horrible viſage our ſauiour Chriſt ſaw of death and hell in the gardein."
