                                "sense_id": "bbd3f51f-d1da-3fb6-9e5b-267f20c820e8",
                                "text": "Still, it's a cosy country, / unracked by riots or strikes / and backward at drug-taking: / I've heard of a dozen lands / where life sounds far more ugsome, / fitter goals for your disgust."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "091177b9-08b8-4d0a-b9c7-5bbec627821e",
